  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "おーいみんなー。お掃除解決隊のコーナー、\nもうすぐ始まるぞー。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_i:step-2:text",
        "step_id": 2,
        "step_index": 1,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 1
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "Legendersの3人、緊張してないかな～。\nっていうか、なんかオレが緊張してきた……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 悠介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_i:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いや、悠介が出るわけじゃないだろ！\nまあでも、ほんと合格して良かったよな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_i:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あめひこサン、今日の出演楽しみにしてたよな。\n元掃除屋の腕をテレビで見せるってさ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 悠介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_i:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あーっ、俺たちもテレビに出たくなってきた！\n今度監督に……っと、そんなこと言ってたら時間だ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_i:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "クリスさん、表情が硬いけど……緊張してる？\nいつも通りでいれば大丈夫だよー。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "北村 想楽"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_i:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ああ。この間も言っただろう？\n俺たちらしさを忘れなきゃいいんだ、ってな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_i:step-18:text",
        "step_id": 18,
        "step_index": 17,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 17
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "2人とも……。そうですね。\n大切なのは、自分らしさを忘れないこと。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "古論 クリス"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_i:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そうですよね、●●●●プロデューサーさん！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "古論 クリス"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_i:step-22:text",
        "step_id": 22,
        "step_index": 21,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 21
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ええ！　自然体でいれば、大丈夫です。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_i:step-25:text",
        "step_id": 25,
        "step_index": 24,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 24
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "皆さんは、そのままの姿が最高に魅力的\nなんですから！　……さあ、行って来てください！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_i:step-26:text",
        "step_id": 26,
        "step_index": 25,
